13
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,090
Within five years he had constant headaches

14
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:26,650
On a full moon night, my whole body felt like being crushed by a giant object. The second part was dedicated to my grandson.

15
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:29,050
On the first day of the first day of the new year, I kneel down, drink wine, and go to the countryside to repent.

16
